<title>USA: Merry Land ups qtrly dividend.</title>
<headline>Merry Land ups qtrly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merry Land &amp; Investment Co Inc said Monday it declared dividends on all outstanding shares, to be paid on March 31 to shareholders of record on March 14 in the amount of $0.39 per common share, $0.4375 per Series A Preferred share, $0.55125 per Series B Preferred share, $0.5375 per Series C Preferred share and $1.03625 per Series D Preferred share.</p>
<p>The company said the common dividend increase of $0.02 per quarter is a 5.4 percent increase in its dividend rate.</p>
</text>
